      "statement": "The resilience primitives are computed from a per-family composite indicator column: Rs = composite[2013] − composite[2008], Rc = composite[2019] − composite[2013], and D = (composite[2022] − composite[2005])_region − (composite[2022] − composite[2005])_national; calculate_rti_score and calculate_rtix_score compute them identically.",
